       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_sdm_332'), 3, 'A similar case on other tables: lesson_progress(user_id, lesson_id, completed_at) with UNIQUE (user_id, lesson_id). Marking a lesson complete twice should keep the first time: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (user_id, lesson_id) DO NOTHING. To fill in the time only when it is still empty: ON CONFLICT (user_id, lesson_id) DO UPDATE SET completed_at = excluded.completed_at WHERE lesson_progress.completed_at IS NULL.');
